Flash1017 runtime research preview

The dependency-cone arithmetic and its numerical shape/DSpark repairs are
ported from the local Flash1017 research work. They are model- and runtime-
scoped; they do not establish universal numerical or quality equivalence.
The integration and lifecycle adapter are local additions under Apache-2.0.

hot_rows.py is copied verbatim from tacos8me/m5-ultra:
https://github.com/tacos8me/m5-ultra/blob/fb233e22762f11e23123437efd4cbfc400a59f07/kernels/omlx/src/omlx/patches/deepseek_v41/hot_rows.py
