The source SPDX header and full license in HOT_ROWS_LICENSE are preserved.
provenance.json records the exact source and license pins.
The bounded cache algorithm is credited to this implementation; the per-model
ownership, shutdown and production integration are separate local work.

This package builds on oMLX's DeepSeek V4.1 runtime and native CED/DSpark paths.
Its use of dependency bounds, padding and dispatch restoration is not a claim
of inventing those general techniques. See the research repository for the
experiment record, full attribution, measured improvements and limitations.
